---
import { ArrowUpRight } from "../../components/icons";
import Layout from '../../layout/index.astro';
---

 <Layout title="Icone Tech - Terms of Service"
 description="Terms of Service Page"
 >
<div class="min-h-screen bg-brand-dark text-brand-cream pt-32 pb-20 px-4 md:px-12">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <a
        href="/"
          class="group flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-yellow font-bold uppercase text-xs mb-12 hover:text-white transition-colors"
        >
          <span class="rotate-180"><ArrowUpRight className="w-4 h-4" /></span>
          Back to Home
      </a>

        <h1 class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-display uppercase leading-none mb-12">
          Terms of <span class="text-brand-yellow">Service</span>
        </h1>

        <div class="space-y-12 font-sans text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display uppercase text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-brand-yellow text-sm">01.</span> Acceptance of Terms
            </h2>
            <p>
              By accessing and using the services provided by Icone Tech Agency ("we," "us," or "our"), you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions. If you do not agree to these terms, please refrain from using our services or website.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display uppercase text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-brand-yellow text-sm">02.</span> Scope of Services
            </h2>
            <p>
              Icone Tech provides creative marketing, branding, web design, and digital strategy services. The specific scope of any project will be defined in a separate Service Agreement or Statement of Work signed by both parties. We reserve the right to modify or discontinue any aspect of our services at any time.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display uppercase text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-brand-yellow text-sm">03.</span> Intellectual Property
            </h2>
            <p>
              All materials produced by Icone Tech, including but not limited to designs, code, copy, and strategies, remain the intellectual property of Icone Tech until full payment is received. Upon final payment, ownership of the final deliverables (as specified in the project contract) is transferred to the client, while Icone Tech retains the right to showcase the work in our portfolio and marketing materials.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display uppercase text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-brand-yellow text-sm">04.</span> Client Responsibilities
            </h2>
            <p>
              Clients are responsible for providing timely feedback, necessary assets (logos, images, text), and approvals required to meet project milestones. Delays in client communication may result in adjusted timelines and additional fees if specified in the project agreement.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display uppercase text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-brand-yellow text-sm">05.</span> Confidentiality
            </h2>
            <p>
              Both parties agree to maintain the confidentiality of all proprietary information shared during the course of the business relationship. This includes trade secrets, business plans, and financial information that is not public knowledge.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display uppercase text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-brand-yellow text-sm">06.</span> Limitation of Liability
            </h2>
            <p>
              Icone Tech shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use our services. Our total liability for any claim arising out of a project shall not exceed the total amount paid by the client for that specific project.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display uppercase text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-brand-yellow text-sm">07.</span> Governing Law
            </h2>
            <p>
              These terms are governed by the laws of the United States and the State of New Jersey. Any disputes arising from these terms shall be resolved in the courts located in Pennsauken, NJ.
            </p>
          </section>

          <div class="pt-12 border-t border-white/10 text-xs uppercase font-bold text-gray-500">
            Last Updated: February 2025
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
 </Layout>